---
import ArticleLink from '@components/ArticleLink.astro';
import BookLink from '@components/BookLink.astro';
import GradientBar from '@components/GradientBar.astro';
import Page from '@components/Page.astro';
import Section from '@components/Section.astro';
import Spotify from '@components/Spotify.astro';
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';

import articles from '@public/arcticles.json';
---

<Layout title="rwl 2021">
  <Page title="2021">
    <nav class="flex flex-row justify-between" aria-label="Read watch listen years">
      <a class="text-blue-600 underline dark:text-blue-400" href="/">&lt; Home</a>
      <a class="text-blue-600 underline dark:text-blue-400" href="/rwl/2022">2022 &gt;</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="space-y-1 text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">
      <p>⏳ - In Progress</p>
      <p>🎧 - Audiobook</p>
    </div>

    <Section title="books">
      <BookLink href="The_Snowball:_Warren_Buffett_and_the_Business_of_Life" label="The Snowball: Warren Buffett and the Business of Life" wiki inProgress/>
      <BookLink href="https://itrevolution.com/the-phoenix-project/" label="The Phoenix Project: A Novel About IT, DevOps, and Helping Your Business Win" inProgress />
      <BookLink href="Bullshit_Jobs" label="Bullshit Jobs" wiki inProgress/>
      <BookLink href="How_to_Win_Friends_and_Influence_People" label="How to Win Friends and Influence People" wiki inProgress audiobook/>
    </Section>

    <hr class="border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800" />

    <Section title="articles">
      <div class="flex flex-col">
        {
          articles["2021"].map((article) => <ArticleLink article={article} /> )
        }
      </div>
    </Section>

    <hr class="border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800" />

    <Section title="albums">
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <p><b>Lamp of Murmuur</b> - <i class="love">Heir of Ecliptical Romanticism</i></p>
          <div class="lg:w-[25vw]">
            <iframe title="Heir Of Ecliptical Romanticism by Lamp Of Murmuur" style="border: 0; width: 100%; height: 42px;" src="https://bandcamp.com/EmbeddedPlayer/album=3383959679/size=small/bgcol=ffffff/linkcol=0687f5/transparent=true/" seamless><a href="https://lampofmurmuur.bandcamp.com/album/heir-of-ecliptical-romanticism">Heir Of Ecliptical Romanticism by Lamp Of Murmuur</a></iframe>
          </div>
          <p>Ripping, catchy black metal with great vocals. Highly recommended.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <p><b>Playboi Carti</b> - <i class="skip">Whole Lotta Red</i></p>
          <div class="lg:w-[25vw]">
            <Spotify album='2QRedhP5RmKJiJ1i8VgDGR' />
          </div>
          <p>Very disappointing, especially considering my love for Carti's past work.</p>
          <p><i>Die Lit</i> is one of my favorite albums of all time. Skip.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <p><b>Pallbearer</b> - <i class="meh">Forgotten Days</i></p>
          <div class="lg:w-[25vw]">
            <Spotify album='7j2AkxHOjfHWD4HSsh7QD5' />
          </div>
          <p>More of a somber album for Pallbearer, and slower too. A little too slow for me. Meh.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <p><b>Valerie June</b> - <i class="meh">The Moon And Stars: Prescriptions For Dreamers</i></p>
          <div class="lg:w-[25vw]">
            <Spotify album='3pjk4sukkPuJXmRhvvYEhO' />
          </div>
          <p>Idk if I just wasn't in the mood for this album, but I couldn't even finish it. Another disappointment from an artist I love.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </Section>

    <GradientBar />
  </Page>
</Layout>
